🏠 Why are villas in Dubai becoming increasingly sought after? 🏡

Most new developments in Dubai consist of high-rise residential buildings. Villas and townhouses, on the other hand, make up a much smaller share of the market, making this segment increasingly limited.

Today, more and more families are choosing homes over apartments. Privacy, a private swimming pool, outdoor space, a safe environment for children, and a peaceful lifestyle are features buyers are willing to pay a premium for.

That is why villas:
🏠 appreciate in value faster than many other property types;
🏠 tend to retain their value better during periods of market volatility;
🏠 remain one of the most sought-after residential property types in Dubai.

At the same time, buying a villa is more accessible than many people think:
🏠 down payment from 20%;
🏠interest-free payment plans directly from developers, with no bank financing required.

